OL,3,GNEWSAEx-council leader jailed for fraud
OL,4,Aand tax evasion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 46-year-old, of Stanton Hill, who
OL,7,Fserved as an Ashfield Independents
OL,8,Fcouncillor on the county council,
OL,9,Fsobbed in the dock as he was jailed for
OL,10,F27 months for nine counts of fraud and
OL,11,Ffour counts of tax evasion.
